    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 18px;">Why a Storm Shelter in Sherman is Essential</h2>
    <div class="rich"><p>Sherman, TX, sits squarely within a region known as Tornado Alley, making it highly susceptible to severe weather events, including powerful tornadoes. Every year, residents in Grayson County face the threat of these unpredictable storms. Having a dedicated storm shelter or safe room is not just a convenience; it's a vital life-safety measure for your family.</p><p>Investing in a storm shelter provides immediate peace of mind. During a tornado warning, you'll know your family has a designated, secure space designed to withstand extreme winds and debris. Our shelters are built to meet or exceed FEMA P-320 and ICC-500 standards, offering the highest level of protection available.</p></div>
  </div>
