        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes, installing a storm shelter in Sherman typically requires a building permit from the city. This ensures the installation meets local safety and structural codes. Texoma Storm Shelters can help you navigate this process and ensure all necessary permits are secured before work begins.</p>
