        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Sherman homes can benefit from various types of storm shelters, depending on your property and preferences. We offer above-ground safe rooms, underground shelters, and garage floor shelters. The best choice depends on factors like available space, foundation type, and ease of access during a storm.</p>
      </div>
